IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ajpa-contempt`

-- Administration of Justice (Protection) Act 2016, ss 3, 4, 5, 11, 12, 13(5), 14, 16 to 21A, 30, 35 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_administration-of-justice-protection-act-2016.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

`a post accusing a judge of bias` MEANS Publication WITH
