    `is a good-faith court filing` IS FALSE
    `was by a non-author without knowledge and with due care` IS FALSE
    `was abroad with no reason to believe Singapore would see it` IS FALSE
    `the publisher had no reason to believe proceedings were pending` IS FALSE

